    "description": "This comprehensive geological collection is designed for education, display, and hands-on learning. The set features a blue-framed, multi-compartment specimen display case housing an array of small, curated mineral samples. Accompanying the display box is a detailed reference guide titled \"Gemstones and Minerals of the World,\" which provides a color-coded identification chart for easy classification. Scattered in the foreground is an assortment of larger loose specimens, showcasing various geological textures in both rough, natural states and polished, tumbled finishes. This collection is ideal for classroom learning, hobbyist rockhounds, or young geologists exploring earth sciences.\nLots are Sold As Is.\nThis auction is a bulk sale, we are unable to provide additional information on individual items featured in this auction. We are unable to verify count or completeness of large lots. All lots are FINAL SALE. No Refunds or Returns.\nAbout Us / Mission\nGoodwill Industries of Ventura & Santa Barbara Counties provides vocational and educational opportunities that eliminate barriers to employment, strengthen communities, and help individuals reach their full potential through the power of work.\nThank you for supporting our mission.\nItem Condition & Seller Disclosure (Important)\nAll items are\nUSED and donated\nto Goodwill Industries of Ventura & Santa Barbara Counties.\nWhile items are visually inspected, our staff are\nnot subject-matter experts\n, and some defects, missing parts, or operational issues may go unnoticed. Descriptions represent our observations at the time of listing and should not be considered expert evaluations.\nPlease review all photos carefully.\nAsk any questions\nbefore bidding\n.\nBy placing a bid, buyers acknowledge and accept the item’s condition as described and shown.\nElectronics Testing & AS-IS Policy\nSome electronic items may not be fully tested due to time constraints, lack of equipment, or item complexity. When an item is\nnot tested\n, this will be clearly disclosed in the listing description.\nImportant terms:\nElectronics are sold\nAS-IS\nunless otherwise stated.\nOnly the testing explicitly described in the listing has been performed.\nIf no testing details are mentioned,\nno testing should be assumed\n.\nPower cords, adapters, batteries, manuals, or accessories are\nnot included unless specifically stated\n.\nUn-tested or partially tested electronics are\nnot eligible for refunds\n.",
